Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.51,0:00:05.29,TL,,0,0,0,,上海大师赛{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}8{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:06.60,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}12{\fs68}号种子霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:08.78,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:11.10,TL,,0,0,0,,逆转范德赞德舒尔普
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:13.56,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘两人一路保发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.56,0:00:16.24,TL,,0,0,0,,霍达尔在抢七里{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68}丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.21,0:00:18.20,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘首局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:20.33,TL,,0,0,0,,他{\fs78}15{\fs68}比{\fs78}40{\fs68}拿到两个破发点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:22.90,TL,,0,0,0,,第二个 截击出界不到一厘米
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:26.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}¡Dame la p*** toalla, coño!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N把那该死的毛巾给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.68,0:00:30.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Code violation, unsportsmanlike conduct,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}warning{\fs68}, {\fs78}Mr{\fs68}. {\fs78}J{\fs68}ó{\fs78}dar{\fs68}.\N违反体育道德 警告 霍达尔先生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.78,0:00:32.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}¿Qué me dijiste, tío?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N你说我什么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:36.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Me ponen warning, tío.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N给我警告 哥们？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.23,0:00:44.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yo entiendo, pero… así no.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我理解 但不能这样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.83,0:00:46.63,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No me hace caso, tío, le estoy hablando.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他不理我 我在跟他说话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.23,0:00:49.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Rafa, pídemelo a mí, y yo se lo pido.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N拉法 跟我说 我替你要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.63,0:00:53.93,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}No puedo repetir… ¿tú sabes lo que dijiste?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我不能重复 你知道自己说了啥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:00:57.73,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Así no, así no hablamos con ellos.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N不能这样跟他们说话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.83,0:01:03.03,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yo te entiendo perfectamente, pero eso no.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我完全理解你 但那样不行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:04.33,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Gracias.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.47,0:01:07.05,TL,,0,0,0,,主裁皮诺阿尔戈特来自厄瓜多尔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.05,0:01:08.91,TL,,0,0,0,,西语他全听得懂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:13.12,TL,,0,0,0,,转播打出的判罚是违反体育道德
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:14.21,TL,,0,0,0,,按 {\fs78}ATP{\fs68} 规则
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:17.05,TL,,0,0,0,,球员须尊重官员 对手 观众和他人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.05,0:01:20.30,TL,,0,0,0,,脏话另有条款 最高罚{\fs78}5000{\fs68}美元
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.72,0:01:24.28,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛中按罚分阶梯处理 第一次警告
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:26.89,TL,,0,0,0,,第二次罚一分 第三次起罚一局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.89,0:01:27.84,TL,,0,0,0,,至于罚款
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.83,TL,,0,0,0,,只有一家西班牙电视台报道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:31.56,TL,,0,0,0,,官方没有确认
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.12,0:01:35.62,TL,,0,0,0,,挨了警告 他反而连拿两分破发
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:37.76,TL,,0,0,0,,第二盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}扳回
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.51,0:01:40.71,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 两个半小时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.71,0:01:42.63,TL,,0,0,0,,他晋级{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:44.81,TL,,0,0,0,,赛后场边采访 他只聊比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:47.63,TL,,0,0,0,,没提这件事 也没有公开道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:53.00,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}So very, very happy how the match went for me today.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N今天这场 我非常非常满意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:55.89,TL,,0,0,0,,这也不是他第一次和球童扯上关系
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.89,0:01:57.95,TL,,0,0,0,,今年法网第三轮对米切尔森
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:01.16,TL,,0,0,0,,一段视频让他被指推倒了一名球童
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.34,0:02:04.64,TL,,0,0,0,,就是这一幕 他从场边走过
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.64,0:02:07.77,TL,,0,0,0,,身旁的球童往后一退 摔倒在地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.74,0:02:11.32,TL,,0,0,0,,他赛后否认 我从没碰到她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:12.65,TL,,0,0,0,,这个机位能看清
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.65,0:02:13.95,TL,,0,0,0,,他确实没有碰到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.95,0:02:17.34,TL,,0,0,0,,是球童后退时 被场边盖布绊倒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:20.88,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2016{\fs68}年法网首轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:23.04,TL,,0,0,0,,克耶高斯大声冲球童要毛巾
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:25.34,TL,,0,0,0,,被主裁拉莫斯判了警告
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:32.38,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}2015{\fs68}年温网 德约冲球童吼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:33.85,TL,,0,0,0,,事后道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.64,0:02:35.82,TL,,0,0,0,,同年在蒙特利尔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:37.65,TL,,0,0,0,,克耶高斯对球童出言不当
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.65,0:02:40.36,TL,,0,0,0,,被追加罚款{\fs78}2500{\fs68}美元
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.84,0:02:44.05,TL,,0,0,0,,一次警告 换来一次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:46.98,TL,,0,0,0,,下一场 火气能留给对手吗？
